# Account-specific values for the AWS deploy helper (scripts/aws-env.sh).
#
# Copy this file to deploy/aws.env and fill in the two values below. That file is
# gitignored — it holds environment-specific config, not secrets, but it stays out
# of git because it differs per account. Everything else (account id, ECR registry,
# EC2 instance id) is derived at runtime, so it does not belong here.
#
#   cp deploy/aws.env.example deploy/aws.env
#   # then edit deploy/aws.env
#   source scripts/aws-env.sh

# --- Required (not derivable) ---

# The private S3 bucket CloudFront serves the SPA from.
SPA_BUCKET=

# The CloudFront distribution id for cortexapp.me (starts with E...).
CLOUDFRONT_DISTRIBUTION_ID=

# --- Optional overrides (defaults shown; uncomment to change) ---

# AWS_REGION=us-east-1
# ECR_REPO=cortex-app
# EC2_NAME_TAG=cortex-ec2
